1226 0 obj
<</ActualText(UBS Evidence Lab - Global Data Centre Capacity \(MW\) Our Global Data Center Monitor from UBS Evidence Lab indicates that data centers in the planning stage increased by 14% \(or 20 gigawatts\) in 1Q26 compared to 4Q25. The combined capacity of under construction and planned data centers has reached 200 gigawatts, doubling within a year. This represents 7x the capacity installed during 2025 and 60% higher than total operational capacity.)/Alt(UBS Evidence Lab - Global Data Centre Capacity \(MW\) Our Global Data Center Monitor from UBS Evidence Lab indicates that data centers in the planning stage increased by 14% \(or 20 gigawatts\) in 1Q26 compared to 4Q25. The combined capacity of under construction and planned data centers has reached 200 gigawatts, doubling within a year. This represents 7x the capacity installed during 2025 and 60% higher than total operational capacity.)/K 3/P 1215 0 R/Pg 2 0 R/S/chart/T(chart)>>
endobj

