1229 0 obj
<</ActualText(UBS Evidence Lab - Global Data Centre Capacity \(MW\), by region From a regional perspective, data centers growth was driven by the US, which accounted for 70% of the increase over the three month period. However, every region showed sequential growth compared to the last quarter. On an absolute basis, capacity expansion remains levered towards the US which accounts for more than 60% of the global under construction and planned capacity, compared to 45% of operational capacity)/Alt(UBS Evidence Lab - Global Data Centre Capacity \(MW\), by region From a regional perspective, data centers growth was driven by the US, which accounted for 70% of the increase over the three month period. However, every region showed sequential growth compared to the last quarter. On an absolute basis, capacity expansion remains levered towards the US which accounts for more than 60% of the global under construction and planned capacity, compared to 45% of operational capacity)/K 6/P 1215 0 R/Pg 2 0 R/S/chart/T(chart)>>
